{"steam_appid":3059070,"steam_name":"The Headliners","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3059070/766488/e7279414be572fb79d4529da0dc6c11a885ca7ce/1750823282/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1733321490","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257061748/20cde7920f5364cfced98614f3597db824e6891f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1733321490","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/d86f7f5a485975c7687b0618c3640d0c44dc4de2/ss_d86f7f5a485975c7687b0618c3640d0c44dc4de2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761229580","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/7dece30a20f56227988fa501c7d9560370d60a2a/ss_7dece30a20f56227988fa501c7d9560370d60a2a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761229580","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/5eb3006f98fa0ba4dc6f9e618d9cf7816ac0997d/ss_5eb3006f98fa0ba4dc6f9e618d9cf7816ac0997d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761229580","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/a8aad75766d9bc845f4427c242ce96904e372fd7/ss_a8aad75766d9bc845f4427c242ce96904e372fd7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761229580","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/db47806019517355162e7d138c5bdcd343934d4e/ss_db47806019517355162e7d138c5bdcd343934d4e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761229580"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/2c569454d10ab9494ea094f4c94fcea7.poster.avif?t=1761229580\" width=600 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/2c569454d10ab9494ea094f4c94fcea7.webm?t=1761229580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/2c569454d10ab9494ea094f4c94fcea7.mp4?t=1761229580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/c96801f30c69f1c12d07387fb7561e74.poster.avif?t=1761229580\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/c96801f30c69f1c12d07387fb7561e74.webm?t=1761229580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/c96801f30c69f1c12d07387fb7561e74.mp4?t=1761229580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As New York falls under attack by mysterious creatures, <strong>you and your team of 1 to 8 fearless journalists must risk everything to snap spectacular photos and escape to make the headlines</strong> ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/1f1114b861e082b04d73ad66da9f6f24.poster.avif?t=1761229580\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/1f1114b861e082b04d73ad66da9f6f24.webm?t=1761229580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/1f1114b861e082b04d73ad66da9f6f24.mp4?t=1761229580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/b7c9a2ba91a2fe94180812152e3cd940.poster.avif?t=1761229580\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/b7c9a2ba91a2fe94180812152e3cd940.webm?t=1761229580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/b7c9a2ba91a2fe94180812152e3cd940.mp4?t=1761229580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the abandoned &amp; dangerous streets of New York, enter buildings, search every dark alley and hidden corner for anything that could be worth discovering. Danger is around every turn.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/a1a6ce8142aa71a36b1e0df45ccbd308.poster.avif?t=1761229580\" width=600 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/a1a6ce8142aa71a36b1e0df45ccbd308.webm?t=1761229580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/a1a6ce8142aa71a36b1e0df45ccbd308.mp4?t=1761229580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/9e33b5244f1cafd5cb383b620e3bc3ad.poster.avif?t=1761229580\" width=594 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/9e33b5244f1cafd5cb383b620e3bc3ad.webm?t=1761229580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/9e33b5244f1cafd5cb383b620e3bc3ad.mp4?t=1761229580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each member of your team is armed with a camera. Snap shots of the destruction, the alien invaders, or even your teammates being torn apart by creatures. The choice is yours—capture the chaos however you see fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/656671fdce56dadc19c431e763a334e0.poster.avif?t=1761229580\" width=600 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/656671fdce56dadc19c431e763a334e0.webm?t=1761229580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/656671fdce56dadc19c431e763a334e0.mp4?t=1761229580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/6f054d5fea2d531155cecc86ee3df106.poster.avif?t=1761229580\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/6f054d5fea2d531155cecc86ee3df106.webm?t=1761229580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/6f054d5fea2d531155cecc86ee3df106.mp4?t=1761229580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you survive the chaos and make it out alive, review your photos and hope they’re headline-worthy. You start with 3 press cards, and each expedition uses one. Only by making the headlines can you earn more and continue your dangerous journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059070/extras/226765728b5edf27b7975d482cd7baba.avif?t=1761229580\" width=684 height=64 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bits)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4440 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bits)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4570 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 30 Series / AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie"],"developers":["KAFI"],"publishers":["KAFI"],"release_date":"30 Jan, 2025"}